    "一次性非消耗型内购，不是订阅。购买后会向 App Store 验证交易，只有验证通过的权益才会解锁。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A one-time, non-consumable purchase—not a subscription. Purchases are verified with the App Store, and only verified entitlements unlock Pro."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "買い切りの非消耗型購入で、サブスクリプションではありません。購入後は App Store で取引を検証し、検証に通った権利のみが有効になります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次性非消耗型内购，不是订阅。购买后会向 App Store 验证交易，只有验证通过的权益才会解锁。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次性非消耗型內購，不是訂閱。購買後會向 App Store 驗證交易，只有驗證通過的權益才會解鎖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次购买，永久使用": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Buy once. Use forever."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
